Delegation: NONE (implemented directly; no sub-agents used).

## Architecture mapping (web → native)

- useBatteryHealthAnalytics  → BatteryDegradationClientFeed (Operations.Analytics.BatteryHealth,
                                GET /analytics/battery-health?vehicle_id=) — primary read; drives the
                                page loading/error/empty state.
- useBatteryDegradation      → BatteryDegradationClientFeed (Operations.Analytics.BatteryDegradation,
                                GET /analytics/battery-degradation?vehicle_id=) — best-effort
                                supplementary read (prediction / risk / projections).
- useSelectedVehicle         → vehicleId passed to the feed (the shell owns the global picker, matching
                                every sibling W7 page; the default shell registration uses the empty feed).
- useUnits / convertDistanceFromSI / formatEnergy → UnitFormatters.FormatDistance/FormatEnergy +
                                UnitConverters.DistanceFromSi at the display boundary (SI on the wire:
                                km*1000 → metres → user unit; capacity_wh → Wh/kWh). UnitPref flows
                                ViewModel → BatteryDegradationProjection.Project(... units ...).
- useHiddenSeries            → native TsCartesianChart legend hidden-series state (W3 chart wrapper).
- i18n t(...)                → ILocalizer.GetString(webKey, englishDefault) via BatteryStrings.Resolve;
                                web key names preserved verbatim (the established sibling convention).

