## Implementation-spec conformance

- Navigation entry         : ShellWindow.xaml.cs PageFactory.Register("BatteryDegradation", …); route in RouteTable.cs L283.
- Page scaffold            : BatteryDegradationPage : UserControl + BatteryDegradationPageViewModel : INotifyPropertyChanged
                             (LoadAsync/RefreshAsync, NotifyOpened); no business logic in the view (thin renderer).
- Panels via design tokens : DisplayTokens.* brushes + TsGlassPanel (Mica/Acrylic glass) — no hardcoded colours.
- 3 data states / source   : loading/empty/error implemented page-level (TsSkeleton / TsEmptyState / TsQueryError) AND
                             per-section (Range/Risk/Recommendations/History each render TsEmptyState; Prediction renders
                             the "need more data" fallback) — never a blank region.
- i18n                     : every visible literal flows through ILocalizer (BatteryStrings) with web key names; zero
                             hardcoded literals in the view.
- a11y                     : AutomationProperties.SetName on the page, every panel/metric/badge/chart; decorative bars
                             marked AccessibilityView.Raw; TsChartContainer publishes an AccessibleSummary; AutomationPeer
                             reports Group.
- Units                    : SI converted only at the render boundary via UnitFormatters/UnitConverters (km*1000→metres,
                             capacity_wh→Wh/kWh); ViewModel sources UnitPref; nothing non-SI stored/computed.

